    "Stability: Stable Build",
    "Description: Version 1.4.0 1.4.0 - Mar 05, 2024 Improvement: we included Omnibus price data for products when retrieving information via GraphQL Improvement: now the Omnibus price of a product is displayed considering the configured settings for tax application and display Version 1.3.0 1.3.0 - Dec 07, 2023 New: now the Omnibus price data is included in API products response Improvement: we changed the logic for displaying Omnibus prices immediately after installing the extension or when creating a new product, when the products do not have data for the 'latest price' Version 1.2.0 1.2.0 - Nov 21, 2023 Compatibility: we added the compatibility with Hyvä Theme for Omnibus Price Tracker. You can find the 'amasty/module-price-history-hyva' package for installing in composer suggest (Note: the compatibility is available as a part of an active product subscription or support subscription)",
    "Version 1.4.0 1.4.0 - Mar 05, 2024 Improvement: we included Omnibus price data for products when retrieving information via GraphQL Improvement: now the Omnibus price of a product is displayed considering the configured settings for tax application and display Version 1.3.0 1.3.0 - Dec 07, 2023 New: now the Omnibus price data is included in API products response Improvement: we changed the logic for displaying Omnibus prices immediately after installing the extension or when creating a new product, when the products do not have data for the 'latest price' Version 1.2.0 1.2.0 - Nov 21, 2023 Compatibility: we added the compatibility with Hyvä Theme for Omnibus Price Tracker. You can find the 'amasty/module-price-history-hyva' package for installing in composer suggest (Note: the compatibility is available as a part of an active product subscription or support subscription)",
