    "Version 1.1.1 1.1.1 - Sep 05, 2023 Fix: we fixed the module compatibility with PHP 7.4 1.1.0 - Jul 20, 2023 New: now it is possible to hide Omnibus prices for specified customers groups Improvement: now it is possible to see Website information on the Price Change History grid",
